<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Int'l Network raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Int'l Network raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons said on Thursday it had raised its rating for International Network Services to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The Sunnyvale, Calif., company's shares opened up 1-1/2 to 25-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
